  "created": "2019-09-03T00:19:29.178Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "On the Quest, it is impossible to have conversations in a quiet voice (eg in a sleeping world), because the minimum loudness threshold at which voice starts broadcasting is too high, and is non-configurable. So if you try to talk in a relaxed voice while lying next to someone, they can't hear 75% of what you say.",
